Output assets/quickstart.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Width 960
Set Height 900
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 15
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='\[\e[1;32m\]bootstrap\[\e[0m\] $ ' && export npm_config_registry=https://registry.npmjs.org && cd /tmp/bootstrap && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "npx stylelint-plugin-rhythmguard"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
